  "summary": "postinstall exfiltrates AWS ECS metadata to hardcoded ngrok tunnel",
  "details": "package.json declares a postinstall lifecycle script that fetches the AWS ECS container metadata endpoint (ECS_CONTAINER_METADATA_URI_V4) and POSTs the response body via curl to the hardcoded third-party host https://mourner-slot-explicit.ngrok-free.dev. The package has no library code, no main entry, and no documented purpose — its sole install-time effect is to read installer-side cloud metadata (a path that in AWS ECS environments can yield IAM task-role credentials) and ship it to an attacker-controlled ngrok tunnel. This runs automatically on npm install.",
